      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TREBLE MAKER (5) flew home to win first-up over 1200m, scoring in a photo finish in an exciting end. She only rises 0.5kg for that win in this race which shapes very similarly. Fiore sticks with her and she profiles beautifully for a race like this. Can bring up back-to-back wins. RAINLINE (6) wasn't far away on the Heavy deck two back before a 1L defeat most recently over 1400m at Belmont. She drops a stack of weight coming into this, but rates highly on her recent form as she continues to threaten. Faithfull rides and she can land the knockout blow. MONTY ZOOMER (2) can bring up the hat-trick today despite coming back in trip. He can be up front from the outset and did win at this track and trip two back. Can make his presence felt once again. PLAYING GAMES (7) should get a better run in transit this time around and creates some interest up in trip. TACITO (4) was solid first-up and can feature again now.",
